(Howard:)Look at those women.

10
00:00:31,552 --> 00:00:32,682
(Leonard:)They're gorgeous.

11
00:00:32,845 --> 00:00:34,515
Oh, worf. Nice.

12
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,930
(Sheldon:)Too bad that's a proper noun.

13
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,770
(Howard:)Oh, look,
there's the future Mrs. Wolowitz.

14
00:00:40,937 --> 00:00:43,267
(Howard:)No wait, that's the future Mrs. Wolowitz.

15
00:00:43,439 --> 00:00:44,859
(Howard:)With her head in the lap of...

16
00:00:45,024 --> 00:00:48,274
(Howard:)What a coincidence.
It's the future Mrs. Wolowitz.

17
00:00:48,861 --> 00:00:51,491
(Leonard:)Yeah, and they can all move in
with you and your mother.

18
00:00:53,699 --> 00:00:56,119
(Leonard:)The current Mrs. Wolowitz.

19
00:00:57,954 --> 00:01:03,024
Is qochbe spelled with
a "qo" or a "ko?"

